factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  Reel script and caption say the campaign ran from 'ஆகஸ்ட் 16 முதல் 27 வரை' (August 16 to 27), but the article gives no month; it says 16 to 27 without naming August.
  Reel script says 'டிசம்பர் 4ஆம் தேதி' is when the CM will be met, which is an approximate match to 'டிச., 4', but the article says 'வலியுறுத்தப்படும்' (will be urged) only; the draft's 'அறிவிக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது' wording slightly overstates it as an announced schedule. (Minor.)
  Slide 3 reads 'முதல்வரை' cut off without the verb, so the sentence is incomplete and has no clear meaning in Tamil.
  Slide 2 title 'முக்கிய' is an incomplete heading with no clear meaning.
  Slide 1 and the reel script attribute the event to 'தமிழக அரசு ஊழியர் சங்கம்' but the reel script lists the campaign as 'பிரசார இயக்கம்' only under the same organisation; this is consistent, so no issue here, but the reel script says the 'கிராம ஊழியர்களுக்கு' benefits were 'வழங்க வேண்டும்' as a demand, which is fine.
  The reel script omits the fact that the campaign was held across the state (மாநிலம் தழுவிய) in its opening description, though it is mentioned later; not a major omission.
