factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script says the ministers 'went to' the cooperative society, but the article only says they inspected production there; minor wording addition is acceptable but the reel_script says they 'went' while the article describes the inspection itself.
  The caption adds 'நேரில் பார்வையிட்டனர்' / the reel_script says 'நேரில் ஆய்வு செய்தனர்' — 'நேரில்' (in person) is not stated in the article.
  The slide says the society operates at ஆண்டிக்காடு, ஆர்.எஸ். சாலை, வெடியரசம்பாளையம 'பகுதிகளிலும்' and the reel_script lists these as places where the society 'operates' — the article says the cooperative society operates at these locations, so this is consistent; however the reel_script's 'வேட்டி, சேலையின் தரத்தையும்' and the claim that the ministers inspected 'the quality of production' is supported.
  The reel_script omits the article's key fact that the inspection was of the quality of Pongal veshti/saree made by the cooperative, and it does not state the ministers' roles, which is a minor omission rather than a factual error.
